5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I worry we are heating the air, not the people. Let us look at the facts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,The silence after a bill reminder is heavy. I want to see where the tension comes from.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious why the old split feels wrong now. I want to check the numbers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I need to know the real cost before I commit. I will look at the statements.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
