35,2,1,talk,Servas,,I found that two rooms need heat much earlier. The lot system is unfair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The bills swing wildly, and people pay late when they question the amount. It is stressful.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I checked the monitors. One room uses four times more than another. It is mostly heaters.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,I saw the statements. February is nearly three times August. And I saw that fixed rates make people waste energy.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The electrician quote is high, 34,000 yen per room. And the template takes hours to fill out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, that confirms my fear. We are paying for cold rooms to heat up.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, the late payments are because we don't trust the numbers. We need transparency.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, I agree. The rooms are different. We should maybe meter them?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, the upfront cost is high, but the monthly swings are worse. I hate the uncertainty.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, the template is too much work for one person. I don't want to be the one doing it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"If we fix the rate, we might waste heat, but we know the cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"If we meter, we know exactly who uses what. No more guessing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,Metering seems fair. But is it too expensive?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,I prefer knowing my exact usage. The fixed rate feels like a gamble.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the maintenance of meters. Who checks them?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us vote on what feels most just.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I want to stop the arguments. Metering might do that.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I think metering is the most honest way.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I will vote for the option that gives me control over my spending.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will vote for the option that doesn't burden one person with endless work.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
